# Claude Code local configuration
# This file specifies what should NOT be committed to git

# Local overrides (user-specific settings)
CLAUDE.local.md
*.local.md

# Sensitive credentials and secrets
**/secrets.json
**/*-credentials.json
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Temporary and log files
**/*.tmp
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Editor and IDE files
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~

# Build artifacts that may appear during testing
**/test-output/
**/debug/
